auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Local trading platform (run-local.ps1).

  1. Select the "local" environment (top-right).
  2. Set the `token` secret to the contents of logs/local/token.txt.
     It is a 1-hour HS256 JWT for account 1; re-run run-local.ps1 for a fresh one.
  3. Send "Place Order", then "List Orders" to see it FILLED / REJECTED.
}
